        "original_id": "aada79f6-5129-5186-9855-afab4141611f",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Charlie Moore\n- Organizations: NBC Sports Network, New England Sports Network, Fenway Sports Group, Delaware North\n- Products: Charlie Moore: No Offense, Charlie Moore Outdoors\n- Topics: Sports television ownership\n\nFacts:\n- Charlie Moore is the host of \"Charlie Moore: No Offense\" on NBC Sports Network.\n- Charlie Moore is the host of \"Charlie Moore Outdoors\" on New England Sports Network (NESN).\n- NESN is an American regional sports cable and satellite television network.\n- NESN is owned by a joint venture of Fenway Sports Group and Delaware North.\n- Fenway Sports Group holds a controlling 80% interest in NESN.\n- Delaware North holds the remaining 20% interest in NESN.\n- Fenway Sports Group owns the Boston Red Sox and Liverpool Football Club.\n- Delaware North owns the Boston Bruins and TD Garden.",
